  many measures could become permanent but  for now the priority will be giving  commuters  the space they need redmond shannon  global news  london and that is global national for  this tuesday i'm donna friesen  it's been 40 years since the marathon of  hope when terry fox made that remarkable  attempt to run across canada  the fundraising for cancer research has  never stopped  now adidas is relaunching the blue orion  sneaker that's the one fox wore on his  epic journey  one hundred percent of the net proceeds  will go to the terry fox foundation  before he started the run fox wrote to  adidas asking for help and it sent him  26 pairs of orion's shoes you can share  what fox in his marathon means to you  using the hashtag thanks terry  and thanks for watching bye  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]
 

